; claude: the brawler kit's 3D half (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_games3d.md,
; section 11): a fighter as a skeleton of boxes, its pose the angles of
; its joints, its moves key poses with the frames between interpolated
; (Skeleton) -- gamekits/brawler/Stickman.ml in three dimensions, and the
; hierarchical transforms that three dimensions need. Used by
; TinyVirtuaFighter.
;
; Its own library rather than part of kit_brawler next door, because it
; draws: elm_playground_3d is a virtual library, so the 2D games
; linking the brawler kit (TinyStreetFighter, TinyFinalFight)
; would have to link a 3D backend too. The rules of a fight -- a move's
; frames, the boxes it hits with -- are the same in 2D and 3D and stay
; next door. A private library, not installed.
(library
 (name kit_brawler3d)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_playground elm_playground_3d)
)
